  "rationale": "Typed ODE contract inherited verbatim: single-state autonomous system for allele frequency p(t), integrator integrate_system, time t the only sampled axis, all 11 fitness/selection/drift/drive constants fixed as parameters, dummy-free (no integration variables). Parameter values are biologically standard: relative fitnesses ~1 with a mild AA>Aa>aa advantage, N_e=100 for finite-size drift, p_star=0.5. The new meiotic-drive term is a saturating transmission distortion against A; I set s_meiotic=0.2 (top of hint) and k_md=0.05 (bottom of hint) to maximize its otherwise-transient signature, giving 8.5*sigma at sigma=0.0006. Window trimmed to t in [0,60] gen (300 pts) so the informative decline is well resolved without a long flat p~0 tail. excitation_ok=true.\"",
